  "video_link": "",
  "rating": "5",
  "item_short_desc": "<p>Rothco&rsquo;s Tactical BDU Shorts are just what you need for the trail, range, and casual style. Constructed from a cotton / polyester fabric blend, our military shorts are built for unparalleled performance, comfort, and convenience while you are on the field. These cargo shorts are not afraid to get down and dirty, standing up during field missions, tactical operations, and law enforcement duties.</p>",
  "no_ratings": "0",
  "sort_order": "16834",
  "description": "<p>Rothco&rsquo;s Tactical BDU Shorts are just what you need for the trail, range, and casual style. Constructed from a cotton / polyester fabric blend, our military shorts are built for unparalleled performance, comfort, and convenience while you are on the field. These cargo shorts are not afraid to get down and dirty, standing up during field missions, tactical operations, and law enforcement duties. High-Capacity Storage: The hiking shorts provide functional utility through 2 large cargo pockets, 2 front slash pockets, and 2 button-down back pockets for storing tactical gear and everyday essentials like your phone, wallet, keys, or multi-tool. Comfortable Button Fly: These tactical cargo shorts come equipped with a button fly for easy on and off, along for a secure fit during outdoor adventures. Perfect Fit: The adjustable waist tabs are designed to give you the perfect, custom fit, every time and anywhere. Upgrade your tactical loadout with these incredible BDU cargo shorts. Action Ready: Initially designed for military personnel and tactical professionals, these adaptable and reliable BDU uniform shorts are great for backpacking, camping, hiking, hunting, fishing, working, public safety, skateboarding, everyday wear, and more. We&rsquo;ve Got You Covered: Complete your look with one of our many T-Shirts from solid color to camouflage pattens and graphic designs. Go ahead and throw on one our Low Profile Caps or Boonie Hats.</p>",
